You are given images of an object instance highlighted in a 3D indoor scene from {n_views} viewpoint(s). The object is marked with a green overlay, red contour, and blue bounding box; a white-background crop is also provided.

Extract a physical simulation intermediate representation as a JSON object with these fields:

1. "object_description": string — one-sentence caption of the object.
2. "scene_role": one of ["static_boundary", "simulatable", "ignore", "unknown"]
3. "geometry_form": one of ["solid", "hollow", "thin_sheet", "filamentary", "stuffed", "uncertain"]
4. "attachment_relation": one of ["free", "partially_attached", "pinned_or_fixed", "hinged_like", "embedded_or_wrapped", "uncertain"]
5. "appearance_material_topk": array of 1–3 items, each {"prototype": <name>, "score": <float 0–1>}
   Prototypes: ["wood_like", "metal_like", "brittle_mineral_like", "rigid_plastic_like", "flexible_plastic_like", "rubber_like", "fabric_like", "paper_fiber_like", "foam_like", "leather_like", "organic_soft_like", "liquid_like", "granular_like", "unknown"]
6. "physical_priors": object with 3 sub-fields, each {"value": <enum>, "confidence": <float 0–1>}
   - "heaviness_bin": one of ["very_light", "light", "medium", "heavy", "very_heavy", "unknown"]
   - "stiffness_bin": one of ["very_soft", "soft", "medium", "stiff", "very_stiff", "unknown"]
   - "surface_friction_bin": one of ["low", "medium", "high", "unknown"]

Example output:

{
  "object_description": "a white fabric curtain hung near the window",
  "scene_role": "simulatable",
  "geometry_form": "thin_sheet",
  "attachment_relation": "partially_attached",
  "appearance_material_topk": [
    {"prototype": "fabric_like", "score": 0.9},
    {"prototype": "paper_fiber_like", "score": 0.05},
    {"prototype": "flexible_plastic_like", "score": 0.05}
  ],
  "physical_priors": {
    "heaviness_bin": {"value": "light", "confidence": 0.72},
    "stiffness_bin": {"value": "soft", "confidence": 0.84},
    "surface_friction_bin": {"value": "medium", "confidence": 0.58}
  }
}

Return ONLY valid JSON. No markdown fences, no explanation.

Object ID: {object_id}
Number of views: {n_views}
View names: {view_names}
Image input mode: {image_mode}
